1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:10,077
Speaking, task two. Card number 17. You are at the station information desk. You want to go to Vienna by train. Ask four questions.

2
00:00:10,767 --> 00:00:14,407
You are at the station information desk. You want to go to Vienna by train.

3
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:18,095
Good afternoon. How can I help you?

4
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:25,633
Good afternoon, when does the train to Vienna leave?

5
00:00:25,833 --> 00:00:27,156
The train leaves at 9:20.

6
00:00:32,367 --> 00:00:33,767
How much is the ticket?

7
00:00:33,967 --> 00:00:36,119
The ticket costs 650 crowns.

8
00:00:41,333 --> 00:00:42,833
Do I need a seat reservation?

9
00:00:43,033 --> 00:00:45,993
I recommend a reservation, it costs 50 crowns.

10
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:52,859
Is there a dining car on the train?

11
00:00:53,067 --> 00:00:55,567
Yes, the dining car is in the middle of the train.

12
00:00:55,767 --> 00:00:58,767
Thank you for the information. Goodbye.

13
00:00:58,967 --> 00:01:00,367
Have a nice trip.

14
00:01:00,567 --> 00:01:09,208
Practise card 17 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
